  "slug": "esers-balsamic-salad-dressing",
  "name": "ESER's Balsamic Salad Dressing",
  "recipe_type": "salad",
  "brief_description": "You can pour this quick and easy balsamic salad dressing over almost type of green salad.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Combine balsamic vinegar, honey, mustard, garlic, oregano, salt, and black pepper in a food processor. Turn the food processor on; pour olive oil in a steady stream into balsamic vinegar mixture until salad dressing is thick and creamy."
    }
  ],
